@startuml
title VEL | Collector Lifecycle State Machine
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam stateBorderColor #2D3142
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateFontColor #2D3142
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #BFC0C0

[*] --> PROVISIONED

PROVISIONED --> ACTIVE : activate command\n(Evidence Runtime)
ACTIVE --> RUNNING : collection request received
RUNNING --> ACTIVE : collection cycle\ncompletes successfully
ACTIVE --> SUSPENDED : suspend command\n(Evidence Runtime)
SUSPENDED --> ACTIVE : resume command\n(Evidence Runtime)
ACTIVE --> ERROR : unrecoverable error\nduring collection
RUNNING --> ERROR : unrecoverable error\nduring collection
ERROR --> TERMINATED : terminate command\n(Evidence Runtime)
SUSPENDED --> TERMINATED : terminate command\n(Evidence Runtime)
ACTIVE --> TERMINATED : terminate command\n(Evidence Runtime)
TERMINATED --> [*]

PROVISIONED : Configured and registered\nwith the Evidence Runtime,\nnot yet active.
ACTIVE : Ready to accept\ncollection requests.
RUNNING : Currently executing\na collection cycle.
SUSPENDED : Temporarily paused\n(resource constraints, maintenance).
ERROR : Unrecoverable error;\ncannot continue.
TERMINATED : Permanently shut down.

note right of ERROR
This state machine applies to EVERY VEL collector,
regardless of source category (runtime, hardware,
or S-CORE module).
end note
@enduml
